Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will not achieve a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:02.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,sustained period of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,strong labor market
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,conditions that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:04.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,benefit all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since early last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,the FOMC has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:07.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,significantly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:08.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,tightened the stance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,of monetary policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:11.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have raised our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,policy interest rate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,by 5 percentage points
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we've continued to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:15.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,reduce our securities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:16.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,holdings at a brisk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:17.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've covered a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,ground and the full
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:20.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,effects of our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:20.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,tightening have yet to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,be felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:22.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,In light of how far
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.47,0:00:23.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,we've come in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.03,0:00:23.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,tightening policy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the uncertain lags
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,with which monetary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:26.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,policy affects the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,economy and potential
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:29.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,headwinds from credit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:30.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,tightening,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,today we decided to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,leave our policy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:32.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,interest rate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:34.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,unchanged and to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:35.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,continue to reduce our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:36.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,securities holdings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looking ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:38.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,nearly all committee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,participants view it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,as likely that some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.09,0:00:42.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,further rate increases
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:42.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be appropriate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,this year to bring
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,inflation down to 2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.93,0:00:46.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,percent over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I
